<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-15T11:48:50.767Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:48:50 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi Prime Minister Barzani told Saudi Crown Prince Mohammed bin Salman that Iraq will not allow its territory to be used for attacks on Saudi Arabia, and Iraq publicly pledged to prevent such attacks. At the same time, the pro-Iran militia Kataib Hezbollah warned it will target any hostile aircraft over Iraq, while a rival armed group said a weapons agreement with Iran remains stalled. Iraq’s Supreme Court declared the Kurdistan Region security law unconstitutional, and US firms are assessing air-defence investment in the Kurdistan Region. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE53TFlFMFN2Y2pVbXVoSWJNdW0yVnlzWlM3T0lzX2hMWmJ1UTZjczZLSnBzLTVpX08wT1ZqV3MzbmVtOU1jZWE0NEdzRlczUG41cEJCZlhlcXNNcjVkVHlBUmFvdkk5ZUxVQ25WYTJfSmhwbXdk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Forum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNSVhucV9lS05KOUFtVnNMeWhfVTJuTkU5OWQ5cFJhd3JXbHhlc0FqSnhTcnhvcU9helRjM1FvdDFvbFc0bkt0X3JTNXZ5NHNxX2ZnckQ0UlNuRmpVYTZ3eEs5WnpaMHI0LXBTWkdkMDJrbDNHYWJfaUZkQlRmLWc5Q2podzAwX0xKbTRuV1RBclRMcEVuTzE0?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOTXB2ZTBIV0hPd1BfYURHWWE2dXFKdl9vRVZLSmxLYnU1cUlxOVVNMXVmMEVuNVIwX0xQNGVrUzRLV1gzdEhTOHZqQnV4RzVMaXlLSndac2JtRzBTUlhXYVkya29XcHpTd2lNSFh3MnBHWFRYNXMtQ2thQ1ZtbFpMdGtKYjc5NHBoV3RSdjA5UTlmRUpNaWJQNE5yc0ZKdC0wcVZhNl9lczBZMVVBVksw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE5yY3ViaWxBNjg5TS1JSGkxWC1mQW1vUWZVNGNhNURibTJ0WEwzOXRzbDVOZTVMV1h4Vy1rMk9Mb0Zv